{"id":"yumor","lemma":"юмор","pos":"noun","rank":4477,"glosses":["humour (something funny)"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/b/b4/Ru-%D1%8E%D0%BC%D0%BE%D1%80.ogg/Ru-%D1%8E%D0%BC%D0%BE%D1%80.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"юмора"},"examples":[{"text":"Люблю твоё чувство юмора.","en":"I love your sense of humor.","words":[{"g":"to love","l":"любить"},{"g":"your","l":"твой"},{"g":"sense, feeling"},null]},{"text":"Я не понимаю их юмор.","en":"I don't understand their humor.","words":[null,null,null,{"g":"them / their"},null],"phrases":[[0,3,"I don't understand"]]},{"text":"У него нет чувства юмора.","en":"He has no sense of humor.","words":[{"g":"at / by"},{"g":"he, it","l":"он"},{"g":"no / there isn't"},{"g":"sense, feeling","l":"чувство"},null]},{"text":"Я один понимаю, в чём тут юмор?","en":"Am I the only one that sees the humor in this?","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"one"},{"g":"to understand","l":"понимать"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"what","l":"что"},{"g":"here"},null]},{"text":"У тебя хорошее чувство юмора.","en":"You have a good sense of humor.","words":[{"g":"at / by"},{"g":"you","l":"ты"},{"g":"good, nice, fine","l":"хороший"},{"g":"sense, feeling"},null]}]}